su name input ob ve float32 1 2 be vector ya
exists su name candidate via state "vector float32" by num 3 be variable ya
ob name input by ve float32 1 0 to name candidate at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name input by ve float32 1 2 to name candidate at num 1 be kl6m psas do
ob name input by ve float32 2 1 to name candidate at num 2 be kl6m psas do
su name first ob ve float32 1 5 4 be vector ya
ob name candidate by name first to name num count be pluk tlas do
